id warehouse-stock
title Check stock levels against a cycle count
lang myra
audience retailers, cooperatives, food banks, aid logistics
safety none
summary Stock per site and item, held as an M global, is decoded exactly and totalled per site. The stock system and a physical cycle count must agree; a difference is held for a stock controller.
step count myra stock.myra sources=stock-system.txt,cycle-count.txt reviewer=stock-controller nonneg=on-hand,qty sum=on-hand by=site
draft stock.myra Write a MYRA schema (one line per M global node, typed subscripts, then ^-separated typed pieces) for the stock the user describes. Use iN for whole quantities, d for dates and ! for required pieces.
